    "tags": ["programming", "algorithm", "递归"],
    "subject": "programming",
    "stem": "用递归计算阶乘：def factorial(n): if n<=1: return 1; return n*factorial(n-1)。factorial(4)的结果是？",
    "options": [
      {"label": "A", "text": "4"},
      {"label": "B", "text": "10"},
      {"label": "C", "text": "24"},
      {"label": "D", "text": "16"}
    ],
    "answer": "C",
    "explanation": "factorial(4) = 4 × factorial(3) = 4 × 3 × factorial(2) = 4 × 3 × 2 × factorial(1) = 4 × 3 × 2 × 1 = 24。每次递归n减1，直到n=1时返回1。",
    "hint": "4的阶乘 = 4 × 3 × 2 × 1。",
    "time_limit_seconds": 45,
    "points": 10,
    "version": 1,
    "created_at": "2026-03-27",
    "updated_at": "2026-03-27"
  },
